messages.content:
The Wednesday production rate is

\[
\text{rate}=\frac{\text{Wednesday production}}{\text{operating hours}}
=\frac{W}{8}
\]

chimichangas per hour, where \(W\) is the total number made on Wednesday.

Since the Wednesday production total is not provided, the exact rate cannot be determined.

\[
\boxed{\frac{W}{8}\text{ chimichangas per hour}}
\]

